Package: gstreamer1.0-alsa
Architecture: any
Section: plugins
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         libasound2 (>= 0.9.1) [linux-any],
         libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: GStreamer ALSA plugin
 GStreamer is a streaming media framework, based on graphs of filters
 which operate on media data.  Its plugin-based architecture means that
 new data types or processing capabilities can be added simply by
 installing new plug-ins.
 .
 This package contains the ALSA audio source and sink plugin, so that
 GStreamer can output and capture audio on an ALSA device directly.

