Package: gstreamer1.0-plugins-base
Architecture: any
Section: plugins
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: GStreamer plugins from the "base" set
 GStreamer is a streaming media framework, based on graphs of filters
 which operate on media data.  Its plugin-based architecture means that
 new data types or processing capabilities can be added simply by
 installing new plug-ins.
 .
 This package contains the elements of the "base" set: audio and video
 converters and scaling, the playback pipeline (playbin, decodebin,
 parsebin, uridecodebin), the typefinder, the subtitle parser and the
 Ogg, Vorbis, Opus and Theora plugins.
 .
 This build has no X11 support, so the X11 video sinks are absent.

